#: data/metainfo/io.github.quai.Quai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Many projects publish their Fedora packages only as .rpm files attached to "
"GitHub, GitLab or Codeberg releases. Installed by hand, those packages never "
"receive updates."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.quai.Quai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Quai turns each project into a small signed dnf repository served on your "
"own machine. dnf, GNOME Software, Discover and rpm-ostree then install, "
"update and roll back these packages like any other Fedora package."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.quai.Quai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Its window is native on both main Fedora desktops: GTK and libadwaita on "
"GNOME, Kirigami on KDE Plasma."
msgstr ""

